Description: CLI-only secure file shredding agent for an OS lab
 Agent 13 of the class Agentic Shell. A per-user background service exposes
 best-effort logical overwriting through a C API and a local JSON socket.
 Physical erasure cannot be guaranteed on SSDs, snapshots or CoW filesystems.
